pbwinput 1
# Phase 4's PC (oracle.py's SEQUENCES: pc), from the catch save, the game the route saved after catching a wild
# Purrloin on Route 19 (catch_save_w2_us.pbwinput): CONTINUE in Route 19's grass, out of it and back through the
# gate into Aspertia City, into the Pokemon Center and up to its PC, left of the counter (the tile at (4,11) is the
# PC's, MapTile_IsPC, read facing up from (4,12)). The PC's menus (res/field/scripts/global_10090.s): Someone's PC,
# the Pokemon Storage System, then each of its first three apps of the PC Box (overlay 255, src/ov255/box2_seq.c):
# Deposit Pokemon, Purrloin from the party into Box 1; Withdraw Pokemon, Box 1 with Purrloin in it, and Purrloin back
# into the party; Move Pokemon, the party opened from the box and Tepig moved onto Purrloin, which swaps them. Each app
# ends with B and NO to "Continue Box operations?", back to the storage system's menu, which jumps back in the script to
# show itself again. Then B out of both menus, the PC switched off, and the field menu's SAVE, whose dialog shows the
# party in its new order (Aspertia City, Pokedex 3, time 0:15). The clock is pinned and the seed line is the random
# seed the DS builds at start-up (oracle.py seeds pc): nothing here builds another. Positions are zone (x, z) tiles;
# counts are GFL's frame count (sVBlankCount). On game frames.
# White 2, with Black 2's presses but one: its catch save leaves the player a tile lower, so its LEFT in the gate is
# shorter.
version w2_us
clock pinned
seed 0x270fd5258c56ebe3  # GFL's, at start-up (oracle frame 20)
1100 START  # START in the opening skips it to the title (count 1115 on both)
1101 -
3000 START  # START brings back the layers the title hid at count 2877
3001 -
3100 START  # START leaves for the start menu and its saved game, which shows from count 3249
3101 -
3400 A  # CONTINUE: Route 19 (zone 437), in the grass at (58,694), where the game was saved
3401 -
3800 LEFT  # out of the grass to (55,693)
3856 -
